{
 "id": 46612,
 "name": "New Infusionsoft Payment to Xero Payment",
 "description": "**Sync New Infusionsoft Payment to Xero Payment**\n- If payment type in Infusionsoft is Refund or payment is found in Xero, finish\n- If the amount due is less than the payment amount, finish\n- If payment type is Credit, add payment and link to credit account  \n- If payment type is not Credit, add payment and link to payment account  \n\n**Parameters**\n- Payment Account Code - Account code for all payments except Credits\n- Credit Account Code - Account code for Credits\n\n**For questions or changes to this recipe contact us at [user@example.com](mailto: user@example.com)**",
 "applications": [
  "infusionsoft",
  "clock",
  "infusionsoft",
  "xero",
  "email"
 ],
